WEBVTT

00:02:00.010 --> 00:02:04.010
These are the Eastern Woods!?

00:02:09.680 --> 00:02:11.700
We're not going to the Eastern Woods?

00:02:13.440 --> 00:02:15.430
Nobody's saying we're not going.

00:02:15.960 --> 00:02:18.470
We're just saying we should delay it for a while.

00:02:19.090 --> 00:02:21.560
Luna's health isn't back to normal yet.

00:02:22.160 --> 00:02:25.610
And it seems lately she can't hear that voice either.

00:02:26.180 --> 00:02:28.220
Then it's okay for Luna to wait.

00:02:28.650 --> 00:02:29.610
Look at this.

00:02:30.040 --> 00:02:32.850
I looked into it again, and it's really amazing!

00:02:33.320 --> 00:02:36.040
This mostly works without electricity...

00:02:36.260 --> 00:02:39.410
...and the parts are so compact I can barely believe it.

00:02:40.290 --> 00:02:43.860
There may be people with a very advanced society!

00:02:43.860 --> 00:02:45.380
We know that!

00:02:46.910 --> 00:02:47.850
Have you forgotten?

00:02:48.640 --> 00:02:51.660
In the Eastern Woods, there are creatures several metres in height.

00:02:52.430 --> 00:02:53.930
We can just attack them!

00:02:54.580 --> 00:02:56.160
I desperately want to go!

00:02:56.160 --> 00:02:58.160
Give it up, give it up!

00:02:58.670 --> 00:03:01.500
You'd get yellow-bellied the moment you saw them!

00:03:01.840 --> 00:03:06.040
We don't know what would have happened to them if Luna hadn't been able to hear that voice.

00:03:06.410 --> 00:03:07.880
There's no need to be impatient.

00:03:10.500 --> 00:03:12.260
Sorry, Shingo...

00:03:12.860 --> 00:03:13.930
It's my fault...

00:03:14.360 --> 00:03:16.440
There's nothin' to apologize for, Luna.

00:03:16.910 --> 00:03:17.720
But...

00:03:17.980 --> 00:03:22.710
We'll go to the ruins once Luna has her strength back and becomes able to hear the voice again.

00:03:23.630 --> 00:03:24.620
Is that agreed?

00:03:28.350 --> 00:03:29.760
Agreed, Shingo?

00:03:32.190 --> 00:03:33.580
I get it.

00:04:07.670 --> 00:04:09.130
Ahh, much better.

00:04:22.910 --> 00:04:26.660
Why did we build this so far away?

00:04:31.130 --> 00:04:33.470
Something's there!

00:04:35.590 --> 00:04:36.510
Howard...

00:04:37.580 --> 00:04:39.240
There's nobody here.

00:04:39.810 --> 00:04:40.950
Howard!

00:04:54.020 --> 00:04:55.780
Oh, it's just you, Shingo.

00:04:56.660 --> 00:04:58.200
Don't surprise me like that!

00:04:59.140 --> 00:05:00.790
You're going to the Eastern Woods?

00:05:02.180 --> 00:05:04.500
Yeesh, your voice is too loud!

00:05:06.580 --> 00:05:08.180
But we talked about this...

00:05:08.790 --> 00:05:11.330
I know, but I can't wait.

00:05:11.740 --> 00:05:12.980
You can't wait?

00:05:13.310 --> 00:05:15.770
You don't understand because you haven't seen it.

00:05:16.090 --> 00:05:19.130
A crab <i>this</i> big is like <i>this</i>.

00:05:19.910 --> 00:05:21.190
It'll attack you!

00:05:21.300 --> 00:05:22.670
Like this!

00:05:23.440 --> 00:05:25.930
Howard, you're scared too.

00:05:27.380 --> 00:05:30.600
Howard, I thought you at least would be different from the rest.

00:05:32.290 --> 00:05:33.530
Now hold on a second.

00:05:34.070 --> 00:05:35.780
Who said I was afraid?

00:05:36.360 --> 00:05:37.780
So you're not afraid?

00:05:38.180 --> 00:05:39.510
Of course not!

00:05:40.030 --> 00:05:42.170
I'm the one who beat the crab, after all.

00:05:42.340 --> 00:05:44.570
You think I'm going to let you lump me in with those other guys?

00:05:46.410 --> 00:05:48.730
In that case, please!

00:05:48.810 --> 00:05:49.650
Take me there!

00:05:49.880 --> 00:05:50.960
But...

00:05:52.370 --> 00:05:54.830
If I don't have someone strong like you with me...

00:05:55.240 --> 00:05:57.880
...I won't be able to come back safely.

00:05:58.930 --> 00:06:00.430
I guess that's true.

00:06:00.680 --> 00:06:02.330
I'm begging you, Howard.

00:06:38.630 --> 00:06:39.920
Good morning, Luna.

00:06:41.380 --> 00:06:42.660
Good morning, Sharla.

00:06:43.260 --> 00:06:44.290
How do you feel?

00:06:45.560 --> 00:06:46.780
I'm mostly better.

00:06:46.990 --> 00:06:47.740
Thank you.

00:06:48.240 --> 00:06:50.100
But you still can't hear it?

00:06:52.110 --> 00:06:53.030
No...

00:06:53.790 --> 00:06:54.410
Really...

00:06:56.190 --> 00:06:57.620
Luna! Sharla!

00:06:59.460 --> 00:07:01.290
Shingo and Howard are gone!

00:07:05.310 --> 00:07:07.430
They may have gone to the Eastern Woods.

00:07:09.530 --> 00:07:12.090
What I'm worried about is that Howard is with him.

00:07:14.140 --> 00:07:15.840
Huh? Where's Chako?

00:07:16.390 --> 00:07:18.920
Come to think of it, I haven't seen her this morning.

00:07:19.260 --> 00:07:20.140
Don't tell me...

00:07:32.340 --> 00:07:33.730
Are we there yet?

00:07:34.290 --> 00:07:36.430
What are you doing, getting tired so soon?

00:07:36.860 --> 00:07:38.980
Put your heart into it!

00:07:42.360 --> 00:07:43.070
Ow...

00:07:47.510 --> 00:07:49.290
Ouch, ouch, ouch!

00:07:51.640 --> 00:07:55.280
What'cha doin'? I was finally sleepin' peacefully.

00:07:55.280 --> 00:07:56.290
Chako!

00:07:56.510 --> 00:07:58.090
What? Shingo?

00:08:00.690 --> 00:08:02.550
Howard's here too?

00:08:02.630 --> 00:08:04.540
What'cha doin', you two?

00:08:05.290 --> 00:08:06.430
What's the meaning of this?

00:08:06.640 --> 00:08:08.550
What do you mean, what?

00:08:09.300 --> 00:08:13.390
I thought she'd be of some use to us, so I figured it might be easier to keep her out of sight.

00:08:13.950 --> 00:08:17.480
Easier'n not bringin' me? Don't talk about me that way!

00:08:21.450 --> 00:08:22.560
Where are we?

00:08:22.880 --> 00:08:24.360
The Eastern Woods.

00:08:24.790 --> 00:08:26.230
The Eastern Woods?

00:08:26.980 --> 00:08:28.370
Why somewhere like that?

00:08:30.320 --> 00:08:30.900
Shingo!

00:08:31.010 --> 00:08:32.850
I just couldn't wait.

00:08:33.190 --> 00:08:34.590
Chako, you understand.

00:08:34.880 --> 00:08:36.560
It ain't like I don't understand...

00:08:37.140 --> 00:08:39.710
...but we were gonna go to the Eastern Woods once Luna's strength was...

00:08:39.710 --> 00:08:40.780
That's it.

00:08:42.790 --> 00:08:44.830
That's why we brought you with us stealthily.

00:08:45.710 --> 00:08:47.440
What's wrong with borrowing you for a little while?

00:08:47.810 --> 00:08:49.590
And we've already come this far.

00:08:50.030 --> 00:08:53.270
While you're pointin' that out, remember that there's huge monsters in this forest!

00:08:53.570 --> 00:08:55.860
You're pretty scared for a robot.

00:08:56.160 --> 00:08:57.130
What'd you say?

00:08:57.380 --> 00:08:59.460
If you're that scared, go home!

00:08:59.740 --> 00:09:02.340
Being dragged around by Luna suits you better anyways.

00:09:04.310 --> 00:09:07.460
What's wrong? If you've got a problem, then spit it out.

00:09:07.590 --> 00:09:09.840
Hey, what's wrong, what's wrong?

00:09:23.160 --> 00:09:25.140
You missed, you missed!

00:09:25.350 --> 00:09:27.020
Serves you right!

00:09:39.020 --> 00:09:40.990
These are the Eastern Woods?

00:09:42.130 --> 00:09:43.370
This is fun!

00:09:45.080 --> 00:09:46.610
I'm hungry!

00:09:47.440 --> 00:09:49.260
You guys try it too!

00:09:50.590 --> 00:09:53.190
Somehow the gravity seems lighter.

00:09:53.460 --> 00:09:54.430
Really?

00:09:55.970 --> 00:09:57.880
That's how he can jump so high.

00:09:58.540 --> 00:10:02.330
Yeah, but I wonder why only the Eastern Woods have less gravity.

00:10:02.510 --> 00:10:04.070
It's definitely strange.

00:10:04.650 --> 00:10:07.630
And there's one more thing I don't understand.

00:10:07.760 --> 00:10:08.760
What?

00:10:10.560 --> 00:10:12.190
Why Howard?

00:10:13.390 --> 00:10:14.960
There was no other way.

00:10:15.260 --> 00:10:18.540
If I'd told anyone else, they'd definitely have been opposed to it.

00:10:18.730 --> 00:10:19.690
Oh, that's it.

00:10:20.140 --> 00:10:22.560
'Cuz Howard's less objectionable than the others.

00:10:26.590 --> 00:10:28.710
There's a shortcut!

00:10:31.440 --> 00:10:33.320
Let's cut through here.

00:10:35.120 --> 00:10:35.940
Chako.

00:10:36.380 --> 00:10:39.110
Well, since I'm already here, there's no helping it.

00:10:39.390 --> 00:10:41.180
Let's check it out as much as we can.

00:10:49.650 --> 00:10:52.890
I remember what you said, but for it to be this large...

00:10:54.000 --> 00:10:55.630
...is definitely strange.

00:11:02.780 --> 00:11:04.330
This is odd...

00:11:04.800 --> 00:11:07.560
We should have caught up with them by now.

00:11:08.230 --> 00:11:10.800
They should have followed the riverbank as well.

00:11:15.880 --> 00:11:18.660
The river passes under this rock.

00:11:20.030 --> 00:11:22.440
We can't follow the river any further.

00:11:22.740 --> 00:11:26.190
Maybe the river continues on the other side.

00:11:27.380 --> 00:11:28.580
Which means...

00:11:32.010 --> 00:11:33.990
We have no choice but to climb this hill.

00:11:35.530 --> 00:11:36.530
Let's go.

00:11:45.380 --> 00:11:46.780
Be careful, Menori.

00:11:47.190 --> 00:11:48.040
I know.

00:11:51.510 --> 00:11:52.580
Menori!

00:12:00.360 --> 00:12:01.330
Are you okay?

00:12:01.690 --> 00:12:02.660
I'm fine.

00:12:03.790 --> 00:12:06.080
But I guess we're over the hill now.

00:12:06.410 --> 00:12:07.140
Huh?

00:12:08.120 --> 00:12:09.660
I wonder where the river is.

00:12:10.520 --> 00:12:12.450
Let's look a little further ahead.

00:12:12.830 --> 00:12:13.860
Good idea.

00:12:26.910 --> 00:12:28.500
This is strange.

00:12:28.500 --> 00:12:29.940
I can't see the river anywhere.

00:12:31.310 --> 00:12:32.330
This is...

00:12:38.010 --> 00:12:39.340
The place from before.

00:12:41.180 --> 00:12:42.640
That's impossible.

00:12:45.320 --> 00:12:46.430
What does this mean?

00:13:08.330 --> 00:13:10.610
This is strange...

00:13:11.210 --> 00:13:14.060
It should definitely have been this way.

00:13:14.630 --> 00:13:16.280
What was a shortcut?

00:13:16.390 --> 00:13:19.180
However far we walk, I can't see the river.

00:13:19.310 --> 00:13:21.280
Maybe we're lost.

00:13:24.150 --> 00:13:25.330
Look out! Hide!

00:13:29.890 --> 00:13:30.960
What happened?

00:13:30.960 --> 00:13:32.340
It's a tobihane.

00:13:32.640 --> 00:13:33.750
A tobihane?

00:13:36.810 --> 00:13:38.930
That's a tobihane?

00:13:39.060 --> 00:13:40.730
Don't be surprised by something like that.

00:13:40.840 --> 00:13:42.980
There's even bigger things!

00:13:45.430 --> 00:13:46.730
Idiot, get back here!

00:13:46.910 --> 00:13:47.480
Chako!

00:13:54.580 --> 00:13:55.560
This is dead.

00:14:02.510 --> 00:14:04.160
It was killed by something!

00:14:06.060 --> 00:14:08.740
Look at these huge claw marks!

00:14:13.070 --> 00:14:13.690
That's right!

00:14:18.260 --> 00:14:19.310
What is it?

00:14:21.580 --> 00:14:24.040
This is weird... there's none anywhere.

00:14:24.380 --> 00:14:25.670
None of what?

00:14:26.930 --> 00:14:28.480
Nano-plants.

00:14:28.950 --> 00:14:29.700
Really?

00:14:30.130 --> 00:14:31.070
No doubt.

00:14:31.540 --> 00:14:34.860
Then the crab they saw was special after all.

00:14:47.330 --> 00:14:48.470
That's what killed it!

00:14:53.290 --> 00:14:55.970
R-- run for it!

00:14:55.970 --> 00:14:58.260
Someone save me!

00:15:02.460 --> 00:15:03.300
Howard!

00:15:03.470 --> 00:15:04.240
Chako!

00:15:04.430 --> 00:15:05.340
Shingo!

00:15:05.340 --> 00:15:07.260
Get out of here!

00:15:07.260 --> 00:15:08.060
Run away?

00:15:13.390 --> 00:15:14.160
It's following...

00:15:14.210 --> 00:15:15.900
Menori, let's run for it!

00:15:21.830 --> 00:15:23.910
At this rate it's going to catch us!

00:15:23.910 --> 00:15:26.060
Can't you hear anything?

00:15:29.850 --> 00:15:31.330
I can't hear anything!

00:15:31.990 --> 00:15:33.620
When it's most important!

00:15:39.960 --> 00:15:41.440
Wait for me!

00:15:43.580 --> 00:15:45.530
Save me!

00:15:46.140 --> 00:15:56.250
Papa!

00:15:58.070 --> 00:15:59.100
Howard!

00:16:01.160 --> 00:16:24.510
Luna!

00:16:24.510 --> 00:16:25.290
Hurry!

00:16:37.350 --> 00:16:39.300
.msahc eht oT

00:16:40.390 --> 00:16:41.930
!msahc eht oT

00:16:46.200 --> 00:16:47.510
Everyone! This way!

00:16:47.720 --> 00:16:48.830
That voice?

00:16:48.830 --> 00:16:49.480
Yes!

00:16:49.800 --> 00:16:51.710
You can hear it again?

00:16:51.710 --> 00:16:52.880
Everyone, let's go!

00:16:56.980 --> 00:16:58.780
!daeha thgiarts ,daeha thgairtS

00:17:13.460 --> 00:17:15.340
What's the meaning of this?

00:17:21.710 --> 00:17:22.520
!pmuJ

00:17:29.740 --> 00:17:31.390
Everyone, let's go.

00:17:31.560 --> 00:17:32.960
Where are we going?

00:17:41.400 --> 00:17:42.320
Luna!

00:17:48.150 --> 00:17:49.740
S-- She disappeared...

00:17:52.330 --> 00:17:53.140
Let's go!

00:17:54.560 --> 00:17:55.910
It's now or never.

00:18:46.880 --> 00:18:48.020
We're saved?

00:18:49.130 --> 00:18:50.190
Is everyone okay?

00:18:50.590 --> 00:18:51.360
Yeah.

00:18:51.540 --> 00:18:52.780
Somehow.

00:18:55.180 --> 00:18:56.610
What was that?

00:18:57.340 --> 00:18:59.460
Maybe it was an illusion.

00:19:00.040 --> 00:19:02.830
Getting lost, the forest, and the cliff.

00:19:03.210 --> 00:19:04.110
An illusion?

00:19:19.050 --> 00:19:20.180
The ruins!

00:19:28.280 --> 00:19:29.890
It doesn't seem to be here.

00:19:31.350 --> 00:19:32.360
Now's our chance!

00:19:42.360 --> 00:19:43.760
It's here!

00:19:44.480 --> 00:19:46.880
I-- I guess this is the crab you mentioned.

00:19:53.960 --> 00:19:54.960
<i>Stop!</i>

00:20:10.580 --> 00:20:11.420
It stopped.

00:20:13.180 --> 00:20:14.100
We're saved.

00:20:14.790 --> 00:20:15.840
What happened?

00:20:16.820 --> 00:20:23.120
.ereh emoC

00:20:26.980 --> 00:20:27.920
Let's go.

00:20:28.710 --> 00:20:30.190
It's beckoning us.

00:20:37.670 --> 00:20:39.920
They might be inside here.

00:20:40.180 --> 00:20:42.530
People of a highly advanced society.

00:20:42.880 --> 00:20:45.390
Maybe, but how do we get in?

00:20:45.690 --> 00:20:47.510
There's nothin' that looks like an entrance.

00:20:58.520 --> 00:20:59.790
I understand.

00:21:10.950 --> 00:21:12.830
What's that, what's that?

00:21:45.020 --> 00:21:46.290
It opened.

00:22:00.730 --> 00:22:01.930
Let's go.

00:22:11.870 --> 00:22:14.340
We're really okay, right?

00:22:46.280 --> 00:22:47.360
It's a person!

00:23:03.080 --> 00:23:05.010
The reason that voice called out to me...

00:23:05.250 --> 00:23:07.260
...was so we would find this boy?

00:23:07.580 --> 00:23:09.840
It's first contact with aliens.

00:23:10.290 --> 00:23:14.040
But the energy system of this place comin' to life means...

00:23:14.460 --> 00:23:18.470
...if we looked into it, we might be able to use it to get back to the colony.

00:23:18.730 --> 00:23:19.480
Chako!

00:23:19.950 --> 00:23:20.830
The boy...

00:23:21.130 --> 00:23:22.390
...opened his eyes...

00:23:23.140 --> 00:23:24.150
What'd you say?

00:23:25.440 --> 00:23:28.480
Next time: Please... take care of this child...
